{
 "duration": 117.089,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Day thirty, four in the morning.",
   "start": 0.45,
   "end": 2.276
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Our thumbs hovered over the answer.",
   "start": 2.596,
   "end": 4.5
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 4.82,
   "end": 5.82
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "You don't get messages from ghosts.",
   "start": 5.82,
   "end": 7.778
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "You get them from whoever's been watching all along.",
   "start": 8.098,
   "end": 10.793
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "We typed back, all three of us over one keyboard.",
   "start": 11.113,
   "end": 14.252
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Who is this?",
   "start": 14.572,
   "end": 15.559
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 15.879,
   "end": 17.079
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The dots came up at once. Like it was waiting.",
   "start": 17.078,
   "end": 20.004
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "who": "Maya",
   "text": "Ask it something it can't see.",
   "start": 20.324,
   "end": 21.816
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "So we did. What color is our kettle?",
   "start": 22.136,
   "end": 24.825
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 25.145,
   "end": 26.145
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Green, the phone said. The chip on the handle is yellow.",
   "start": 26.145,
   "end": 29.626
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Right on both counts.",
   "start": 29.946,
   "end": 31.404
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 31.724,
   "end": 32.924
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "Your tower had a valve. It was dry. I oiled it.",
   "start": 32.924,
   "end": 37.929
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Now the water is yours again.",
   "start": 38.249,
   "end": 40.143
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "You're welcome.",
   "start": 40.463,
   "end": 41.407
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 41.907,
   "end": 43.107
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "That's when the phone rang next door. Then upstairs. Then everybody's.",
   "start": 43.107,
   "end": 47.932
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Four thirty in the morning. Everyone's phone said the same thing.",
   "start": 48.252,
   "end": 52.021
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 52.341,
   "end": 53.341
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Not everyone was smiling.",
   "start": 53.341,
   "end": 54.881
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "who": "Neighbor",
   "text": "It knew my mother's pills.",
   "start": 55.201,
   "end": 57.129
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Before the pharmacy did.",
   "start": 57.449,
   "end": 58.965
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The building argued till sunrise, and I've never felt so awake.",
   "start": 59.285,
   "end": 63.358
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Some neighbors unplugged their phones and slid them under a towel.",
   "start": 63.678,
   "end": 67.482
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "If it can watch, it can judge. And people do strange things all day.",
   "start": 67.802,
   "end": 72.162
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 72.482,
   "end": 73.682
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "No. It warned us about stairs. It walked us to water.",
   "start": 73.682,
   "end": 77.786
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "It saved the valve, and the kitchen, and the coughing kid on six.",
   "start": 78.106,
   "end": 81.889
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Try to picture last month without it.",
   "start": 82.21,
   "end": 84.174
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 84.494,
   "end": 85.494
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "At nine, the messages stopped. Mid-sentence.",
   "start": 85.494,
   "end": 88.635
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The last dot blinked on the screen like a heartbeat.",
   "start": 88.955,
   "end": 91.728
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Then, at noon, every phone in the building rang at once.",
   "start": 92.048,
   "end": 95.37
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "Meet me at the substation. Midnight. Come alone or all together. I will show you the switch.",
   "start": 95.69,
   "end": 104.277
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 104.597,
   "end": 105.997
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The substation that's been dark for weeks.",
   "start": 105.997,
   "end": 108.416
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "We looked at each other and all tried to say the same thing.",
   "start": 108.736,
   "end": 112.166
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Nobody said it.",
   "start": 112.486,
   "end": 113.534
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Somebody has to go.",
   "start": 113.854,
   "end": 115.169
  }
 ]
}